      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a55f2c46765067d861f5004|full_name}: \nThere may be a discrepancy in communication so I note here:\n>-Frequency does seem to be from 0 to 320, but from @Yodokoro findings and current experience, it seems to cap at 100 in VRChat (for Vive anyway)\nThis is simply meaning that the vibration is too fast to recognize the difference. I wasn't sure if there was a cap internally.\nThank you for your update here.\n(原文/Original text)\nコミュニケーションに齟齬があるかもしれないので補足します。\nこれは単に振動が速すぎて違いを感じ取れなかったという意味です。内部的にcapがあるかどうかはわかりませんでした。\n更新ありがとうございました。",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
