      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After testing with Quest, it seems that there's two bugs:\n-Any duration longer than 2 seconds softlock the controllers into vibrating continuously (until you send a vibration that is less than 2 seconds)\n-Frequency does not seem to change anything (and a frequency of 0 still vibrate the controller)\nThe amplitude is much better than the Vive Wands & Index counterparts though, much stronger.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
